      <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.35; margin-bottom: 18px;">Destination Handover, Odometer Sign-Off &amp; Joint Condition Inspection for Car Transportation In Samthar</h2>
      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p>Upon arrival at the final destination, the driver must initiate a structured handover process to ensure clarity and accountability regarding the vehicle's condition. The operation begins in daylight conditions, which are critical for accurate visual assessment.</p>
<p>The recipient should conduct a thorough re-inspection of the automobile, meticulously comparing its current physical state against the digital pickup photos captured at the origin. This step ensures that any pre-existing damage or new transit-related issues are clearly identified and documented before the transfer of responsibility is finalized.</p>

<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-top: 24px;">
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
