  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #10b98122; color: #10b981; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">02</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Protocol 02</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Inspect the interior components, including upholstery, dashboard controls, and infotainment systems, ensuring they match the condition noted in the pickup documentation.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #3b82f622; color: #3b82f6; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">03</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Protocol 03</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Confirm that all personal items or accessories listed in the manifest are present and undamaged within the vehicle's storage compartments.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<p>Following the visual inspection, the driver and recipient must jointly perform an odometer verification. This involves checking the current mileage displayed on the vehicle's dashboard and comparing it directly against the figures recorded on the Logistics Receipt (LR) bilty.</p>
<p>Any significant discrepancy between the pickup and delivery readings must be investigated immediately to rule out unauthorized usage or mechanical tampering. The LR bilty serves as the primary legal document for this transaction, and its data must align with the physical reality of the vehicle to maintain compliance with transport regulations.</p>

<ul>
    <li>Cross-reference the final odometer reading with the initial value noted on the LR bilty to calculate the exact distance traveled.</li>
    <li>Document any variance exceeding a reasonable tolerance range, noting potential causes such as test drives or mechanical errors.</li>
    <li>Ensure the fuel level matches the agreement specified in the transport contract, noting any deviations for potential billing adjustments.</li>
</ul>

<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">Once the visual and mechanical checks are complete and all discrepancies are resolved or noted, the final step is the execution of the signed condition sign-off.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 16px 0 20px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;"><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>Both the driver and the recipient must review the inspection notes and agree on the vehicle's final status.</span></li><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>The recipient signs the delivery receipt, acknowledging that the vehicle has been received in the condition described, barring any noted exceptions.</span></li></ul>
<p>This signature legally transfers custody and risk from the logistics provider to the owner. It is imperative that this sign-off occurs only after all queries have been addressed, ensuring a transparent and dispute-free conclusion to the automobile transport journey.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>



